      "text": "Expanding the two bracketed expressions gives \\[ \\begin{aligned} &[x-(y-x)]-[(x-y)-x]\\\\ &\\qquad=(2x-y)-(-y)=2x. \\end{aligned} \\]\n\nThus the correct answer is B.",
